flowchart TB
    A[Position Independent, Code -fPIC] --> B{Why needed?}
    B --> C[Shared library can be, loaded at any address]
    B --> D[Multiple processes share, same physical memory]
    
    C --> E[Code relocation, handled by linker]
    D --> F[Memory efficiency]
    
    G[Without -fPIC] --> H[Absolute addresses, hardcoded]
    H --> I[Each process needs, separate copy]
    I --> J[Wasted memory]
    
    E --> K[GOT for data, PLT for functions]
    K --> L[Single shared copy]
    L --> M[Many processes]
    
    style F fill:#c8e6c9
    style L fill:#c8e6c9
    style J fill:#ef9a9a
